14-a-small-group-in-goulburn-began-pursuing-a-community-owned-solar-farm-12-years-later-300-mostly-local-investors-had-raised-3-3-million-and-the-1-4mw-plant-with-a-4mwh-battery-opened/articleshow/134491021.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2014-a-small-group-in-goulburn-began-pursuing-a-community-owned-solar-farm-12-years-later-300-mostly-local-investors-had-raised-3-3-million-and-the-1-4mw-plant-with-a-4mwh-battery-opened/articleshow/134491021.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T00:58:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134491933,imgsize-1262775.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Man using metal detector finds 4,000+ Viking Age silver coins buried 39 feet apart]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134491785.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-man-using-a-metal-detector-near-a-finnish-village-finds-more-than-4000-viking-age-silver-coins-in-two-birch-bark-containers-buried-39-feet-apart/articleshow/134491785.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-man-using-a-metal-detector-near-a-finnish-village-finds-more-than-4000-viking-age-silver-coins-in-two-birch-bark-containers-buried-39-feet-apart/articleshow/134491785.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T00:52:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134491875,imgsize-2618600.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[TPUSA insisted Charlie Kirk should speak outdoors despite security concerns, claims bombshell report; Candace Owens says 'my jaw is on the floor']]></title><description>&lt;img